nner role is an error. `pending` on an LLM scanner is also an error; today nothing triggers it, so it is a hook for #204.\n- **Pipeline:** `internal/scanner/pipeline.go` changes where issues are created, where they are joined and what labels the synthetic dry-run issues carry.\n- **Guard:** a new `internal/scanner/guard.go` runs right after the scan and before any diff or write. It checks the built-in secret scan, gitleaks when enabled, and the known-value check on each decoded field. A hit or a scan error records `scan_failed`, logs only the finding index, rule and field, and also runs in dry-run.\n- **Stale closer:** it already skips issues without `ard:pending` and issues with `ard:needs-human`, so the plan adds tests only, no code.\n- **Docs:** the proposal gets the `route:` and guard text and the new label-table row.\n\nOpen points in the comment:\n\n- **Rows before the guard:** reconcile and the dry-run ledger adoption run before the scan, so they can still refresh local finding rows before the guard. A maintainer should confirm that \"no finding row changes\" allows this.\n- **Gitleaks cost:** running gitleaks once per field would be slow, so the plan tells the worker to prefer one buffer per finding.\n\nNeither file touches the protected paths.","ttft_ms":1200,"type":"result","duration_ms":68712,"uuid":"751e631e-17bd-4f87-abff-3a6272bbfd83","ttft_stream_ms":635,"time_to_request_ms":26,"first_content_frame_ms":635,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":24,"outputTokens":8754,"cacheReadInputTokens":348042,"cacheCreationInputTokens":47787,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.3135402,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":979,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":47787,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
